Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:09.442
♪

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:10.343 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dagen: WELCOME BACK, TIME

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:12.479 line:78%
FOR "THE FASTEST," BRADLEY

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:16.216 line:78%
COOPER IS REPORTEDLY DATING

00:00:12.579 --> 00:00:16.750 line:78%
HUMA ABEDIN, THE TOP CONFIDENT

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:20.020 line:78%
TRADING HER HUSBAND

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:24.157 line:78%
ANTHONY WEINER FOR IN A LISTER.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:34.901 line:78%
GREG, WHO DEAR AT THE TWO TREAD

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:35.902 line:78%
WHERE THE DASHED OFF THE TREAD?

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:37.037 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: I DON'T KNOW WHY THEY

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:40.407 line:78%
ARE DOING THIS, BUT IT DOES NOT

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:42.842 line:78%
EVEN MAKE SENSE TO ME.

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:43.143 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WHY DOES IT NOT MAKE

00:00:42.942 --> 00:00:44.044 line:78%
SENSE?

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:44.778 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: BECAUSE

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:47.147 line:78%
ANTHONY WEINER WAS SUCH A PRIZE

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.481 line:78%
IN A MOVE ON TO TRASH LIKE

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:51.284 line:78%
BRADLEY COOPER, LET'S BE HONEST,

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:53.086 line:78%
GOING DOWNHILL.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:53.787 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dagen: AND ANNA WHITMORE

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:56.423 line:78%
WAS THE MATCHMAKER, I'M SURE

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:58.391 line:78%
THAT THIS IS FOREVER.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:59.426 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Martha: I LOVE THE ROMANTIC

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:01.361 line:78%
STATEMENT FROM THE SOURCE, THEY

00:00:59.526 --> 00:01:03.763 line:78%
ARE PERFECT FOR EACH OTHER, BOTH

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:04.097 line:78%
INTO POWER, POLITICS, AND HUMAN

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.698 line:78%
AFFAIRS.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.433 line:78%
ISN'T THAT WHAT YOU SAY WHEN TWO

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:09.602 line:78%
GREAT PEOPLE THAT YOU LOVE FALL

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:13.173 line:78%
FOR EACH OTHER?

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:15.742 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: ANONYMOUS GOSSIP

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:16.242 line:78%
QUOTES, LEADING LIKE A HUMAN

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:16.843 line:78%
BEING.

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.811 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jessica: LEADING WITH

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:20.046 line:78%
POWER.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.413 line:78%
AND PROBABLY PART OF THE WHOLE

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.182 line:78%
THING.

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:22.615 line:78%
THAT'S WHAT IT WILL TURN OUT TO

00:01:22.282 --> 00:01:24.284 line:78%
BE.

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:27.554 line:78%
I WAS SURPRISED BY IT THOUGH.

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:30.957 line:78%
THAT IT WAS EVEN A FAKE,

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:32.125 line:78%
POTENTIALLY AFFECTING.

00:01:31.057 --> 00:01:33.827 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: I JUST WANTED TO

00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:35.628 line:78%
TAKE ANOTHER LOOK AT YOU.

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:39.732 line:78%
I THOUGHT THIS WAS REAL AND NOW

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:40.934 line:78%
YOU GUYS ARE MAKING ME FEEL --

00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.001 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jessica: NAIVE?

00:01:41.034 --> 00:01:44.304 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: NAIVE.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.971 line:78%
LISTEN, I DON'T KNOW WHAT HE IS

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.840 line:78%
DOING.

00:01:45.071 --> 00:01:48.842 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: GET ANTHONY ON YOUR

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.642 line:78%
SHOW TO TALK ABOUT THIS.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.243 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: SHOULD I HAVE THEM

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.512 line:78%
ON THE SHOW?

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:53.313 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: I TRIED, HE SAID NO

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:55.281 line:78%
TO ME.

00:01:53.413 --> 00:02:01.154 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Martha: TRY AGAIN.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:02:02.789 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Jesse: WEINER IF YOU ARE

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:07.260 line:78%
WATCHING?

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:08.962 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Martha: HE IS THE BIGGEST

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:13.867 line:78%
JACKASS ON EARTH.

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:15.135 line:78%
A STONE COLD --

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:15.802 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: HE USED TO COME ON

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.003 line:78%
FOX ALL THE TIME.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:18.771 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Dagen: BECAUSE HE USED TO

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:20.206 line:78%
BE A LITTLE AND TALK DOWN TO THE

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:21.841 line:78%
PEOPLE IN OUR GREENROOM, AND

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:23.810 line:78%
THERE IS NO LOWER LOW THAN THAT.

00:02:21.941 --> 00:02:25.778 line:78%
&gt;&gt; Greg: TO BE FAIR, THOSE

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:26.079 line:78%
PEOPLE ARE JOKES.

